{
    "title": "phpolars and py-polars",
    "description": "phpolars and py-polars both run Polars' Rust engine. phpolars embeds the Rust crate at version 0.55.2, built with Cargo's release profile; py-polars ships its own build of the engine. The data are a 1M-row CSV (k: 100,000 keys, g: 50 groups, x: integers with 2% missing, y: floats; 22 MB) and a 100,000-row lookup table on k. Each case runs once to warm up and then five times; the value is the median. Both use 2 Polars threads (phpolars' default php_polars.max_threads), py-polars 1.43.2 on Python 3.14.7. Results stay in Polars; converting them to PHP arrays is not timed.",
